 "note": {
  "zh": "★S-1 提取档（2026-08-26）：由 analysis.html 的出厂控件值机械提取，不是页面导出的会话文件——接线后应由页面导出替换以完成往返校验。内容：合成序列驱动（5 个时间片，t 1→5 s，Ip 320→460 kA，β 0.35→0.70，线圈源按片）。",
  "en": "★S-1 extraction (2026-08-26): mechanically lifted from analysis.html factory control values, NOT a page-exported session file — once wired, replace with a page export to close the round trip. Contents: the synthetic series driver (5 time slices, t 1→5 s, Ip 320→460 kA, β 0.35→0.70, per-slice coil source)."
 },
